    <string name="settings_voice_offline">Prefer offline voice</string>
    <string name="settings_voice_offline_body">Ask your speech engine to recognize speech on this phone instead of online, if it can. Weft always uses the engine chosen in system settings.</string>
    <string name="settings_suggestions">Show suggestions</string>
    <string name="settings_suggestions_body">Word suggestions and next-word predictions above the keys.</string>
    <string name="settings_autocorrect">Autocorrect</string>
    <string name="settings_autocorrect_body">Fix typos when you press space. Press delete right after to undo.</string>
    <string name="settings_emoji_suggestions">Emoji suggestions</string>
    <string name="settings_emoji_suggestions_body">Offer an emoji in the strip when a word names one, like 🍕 for “pizza”. Tap it to add it after the word.</string>
    <string name="settings_swipe_visuals">Enhanced visuals</string>
    <string name="settings_swipe_visuals_body">A trail that tapers toward its tail, and letters that light up as you cross them. Off shows a plain trail. Either way, swipes are recognized the same.</string>
    <string name="settings_swipe">Swipe typing</string>
    <string name="settings_swipe_body">Slide across the letters to type a word, lifting between words. Spaces are added for you; delete removes the whole word.</string>
    <string name="settings_learn">Learn from my typing</string>
    <string name="settings_learn_body">Remember new words, the words you use most, which words you type together and how you swipe (where your thumb lands, and which of the guesses you pick), so suggestions and swipe fit you. Undoing a correction keeps that word as you typed it. Stored only on this device, never in password, incognito, email or web address fields.</string>
